# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository for anything Git detects as
# text, regardless of what line endings a given OS/editor checks it out
# with. Without this, files committed with CRLF (Windows) and LF (Linux/Mac)
# get mixed in the same repo, which is what caused `git status` to show
# nearly the whole tree as "modified" throughout 2026-09-12's session even
# with no real changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary types: never touch these regardless of Git's text heuristic.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
